       "text": "Mr. Okafor reads the log standing up, the way he reads everything, with one thumb moving down the glass. The wall clock says 06:37. It is 06:35.",
       "file": "/night-shift/okafor-reads-wall/media/line-1.mp3",
       "dur": 11.9
